{"issues":[{"expand":"renderedFields,names,schema,operations,editmeta,changelog,versionedRepresentations","id":"20418","self":"https://mojira.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/issue/20418","key":"MC-275276","renderedFields":{"summary":null,"issuetype":null,"watches":null,"customfield_10070":null,"customfield_10061":"","created":"15/Aug/24 11:16 AM","customfield_10050":"","customfield_10051":null,"description":"<p><b>Steps to reproduce</b>:</p>\n<ol>\n\t<li>Build the following setup:<br>\n<span class=\"image-wrap\" style=\"\"><a id=\"36763_thumb\" href=\"/rest/api/3/attachment/content/36763\" title=\"Setup.png\" file-preview-type=\"image\" file-preview-id=\"36763\" file-preview-title=\"Setup.png\"><jira-attachment-thumbnail url=\"https://mojira.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/attachment/thumbnail/36763?default=false\" jira-url=\"https://mojira.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/attachment/thumbnail/36763\" filename=\"Setup.png\"><img src=\"https://mojira.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/attachment/thumbnail/36763\" data-attachment-name=\"Setup.png\" data-attachment-type=\"thumbnail\" data-media-services-id=\"c09069f0-47c1-407c-b3f8-da6669e5eb5d\" data-media-services-type=\"file\" style=\"border: 0px solid black\"></jira-attachment-thumbnail></a></span></li>\n\t<li>Push the minecart down the slope</li>\n</ol>\n\n\n<p><b>Observed result</b>:<br>\n<span class=\"image-wrap\" style=\"\"><a id=\"36762_thumb\" href=\"/rest/api/3/attachment/content/36762\" title=\"Observed.png\" file-preview-type=\"image\" file-preview-id=\"36762\" file-preview-title=\"Observed.png\"><jira-attachment-thumbnail url=\"https://mojira.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/attachment/thumbnail/36762?default=false\" jira-url=\"https://mojira.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/attachment/thumbnail/36762\" filename=\"Observed.png\"><img src=\"https://mojira.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/attachment/thumbnail/36762\" data-attachment-name=\"Observed.png\" data-attachment-type=\"thumbnail\" data-media-services-id=\"a987062c-4cdf-409b-a1ce-c13ed0d4118a\" data-media-services-type=\"file\" style=\"border: 0px solid black\"></jira-attachment-thumbnail></a></span></p>\n\n<p><b>Expected result</b>:<br>\nThe minecart would not phase through the block at the bottom of the slope.</p>\n\n<p>It occurs with all types of rails, and the faster it goes, the more likely it is to go onto the rails to the left.</p>","customfield_10054":null,"fixVersions":null,"customfield_10055":null,"resolution":null,"customfield_10047":"15/Aug/24 10:06 PM","customfield_10048":null,"labels":null,"customfield_10049":null,"attachment":[{"self":"https://mojira.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/attachment/36758","id":"36758","filename":"2024-08-18_20.15.20.png","author":{"avatarUrls":{"48x48":"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/d70168bc4d0c82762f0a18f8b5637505?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FM-5.png","24x24":"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/d70168bc4d0c82762f0a18f8b5637505?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FM-5.png","16x16":"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/d70168bc4d0c82762f0a18f8b5637505?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FM-5.png","32x32":"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/d70168bc4d0c82762f0a18f8b5637505?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FM-5.png"},"displayName":"migrated","active":true,"timeZone":"America/Los_Angeles","accountType":"atlassian"},"created":"18/Aug/24 5:16 AM","size":"412 kB","mimeType":"image/png","content":"https://mojira.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/attachment/content/36758","thumbnail":"https://mojira.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/attachment/thumbnail/36758"},{"self":"https://mojira.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/attachment/36759","id":"36759","filename":"2024-08-18_20.19.27.png","author":{"avatarUrls":{"48x48":"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/d70168bc4d0c82762f0a18f8b5637505?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod